  "cards": [
    {"dot":"cyan","title":"Follow the numbered loop","items":["01–08 is the normal Mission / Strategic Delta path, not a historical timeline. Corrections survive reload and inhibit the rejected move; insufficient context names the missing input.","Context readers combine the browser read with the separate review-server reader. Arrows out of stores show returned data, not stores initiating calls. Only review context reads saved actions and confirmed lessons."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Reasoning has no authority to commit","items":["Optional project review: explicit owner request, authenticated account-scoped reads, bounded proposal → one critique. Its source-bound cache lives in mission_events; it is neither a canonical action nor verified evidence.","Model and human-supplied candidates face the same deterministic gates. Accept records agreement only. SavedActions performs the separate explicit actions insert. No action → evidence edge exists."]},
    {"dot":"amber","title":"Learning is human, scoped and reversible","items":["The lesson API requires a current valid review for confirmation, plus a human-edited rule, conditions and scope. Retirement appends the exact confirmation ID; later reads exclude it.","Confirmed rules return through the ledger to subsequent review context. They are not verified outcomes, automatic doctrine updates, or permission for an autonomous loop."]},
    {"dot":"slate","title":"Snapshot and limits","items":["Source snapshot: local feat/brief-tab at 18f8b68e80c3ac97a59497d28f3806cf8233129b. This is current checked-out code, not a claim of merge, deployment or successful production reasoning.","The Brief tab exists on this branch but is display-only and outside the Delta loop. Clause-only model assistance is summarized by the candidate gate, not shown as another primary path.","Evidence ingestion, production row contents, provider availability and real owner-session behavior are not verified here. The initial worktree had untracked docs/plans/; cited source files are committed bytes."]}
